00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
On Mars, your doctor is on Earth: up to 22 minutes away, each way.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,650
A one-minute offline health check, judged against your own normal.

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:13,900
90 days of an astronaut's heart rate: inside her own normal, until today.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:18,550
Can Earth answer in time? If not, the crew decides now.

5
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:22,600
A signed, encrypted report reaches the flight surgeon on Earth.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,850
Real NASA Inspiration4 data: 4 of 4 crew changed vs their own normal.

7
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,450
ASCLEPIUS: medicine for when Earth is too far away.
